OL,3,GNEWSAEndangered water voles introduced
OL,4,Ato reserve
OL,5,
OL,6,FSurrey Wildlife Trust has introduced 30
OL,7,Fnationally-endangered water voles to a
OL,8,Fnature reserve near Elstead.
OL,10,FThe release on the River Wey comes
OL,11,Ffollowing a "successful" release on the
OL,12,Fupper river.
OL,14,FThe water voles are being introduced
OL,15,Fdownstream on 10 sites between Frensham
OL,16,Fand Elstead, the wildlife trust said.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
