OL,3,GNEWSAEndangered water voles introduced
OL,4,Ato reserve
OL,5,
OL,6,FJames Herd, director of reserves
OL,7,Fmanagement at the trust, said: "As we
OL,8,Fwork towards the restoration of natural
OL,9,Fecosystems and landscapes county wide,
OL,10,FI hope this release is one of many
OL,11,Freintroductions of native species that
OL,12,Fwe'll see in the years ahead."
